notes.content:
Hey players,
in this update among numerous minor bugfixes and improvements:
[list]
[*] we introduce [b]ExpertMode[/b] for players expecting more [i]extreme[/i] experience (game resets on death);
[*] we wanted the game to be more accessible for people of all heights, so there are always ways to reach high places other than just being high;
[*] improved lighting quality;
[*] added game length statistic at ending screen
[*]
[*] Ending And Starting The Experience Results in Endless Good Game introduced ;) ;
[/list]

See you next time!
